2/29/qg5qwlj1lcy3blxkm5cgiz8i3pm3kvn.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%94%8B%E5%85%89%E4%B9%8D%E7%8E%B0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/29/qg5qwlj1lcy3blxkm5cgiz8i3pm3kvn.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%94%8B%E5%85%89%E4%B9%8D%E7%8E%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/29/qg5qwlj1lcy3blxkm5cgiz8i3pm3kvn.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />锋光乍现\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。被[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">正、侧方</span>]敌人攻击时，若攻击方拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"倒吊人标记\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">倒吊人标记</font></span></span>]，则触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]，可打断其行动，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>物理伤害，再传送到自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>格内最近友军周围。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%A6%E4%BC%BD%E5%8B%92\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伦伽勒\"><img alt=\"头像 伦伽勒.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/dc/s1bk0m2lj5bxpmhksm1nmgqccdtv0pd.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:7